message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Open Behavioral Data Toolkit"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Ubaidillah
    given-names: Mohamad Iksan
repository-code: "https://github.com/meworo/open-behavioral-data-toolkit"
# Add `date-released: YYYY-MM-DD` when the v0.1.0 release is actually tagged.
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python toolkit for behavioral research: data validation,
  questionnaire scoring, descriptive statistics, Cronbach's alpha, correlation
  analysis and structured reporting with reproducibility metadata. Descriptive
  tools only; no diagnostic or clinical functionality.
keywords:
  - behavioral science
  - psychology
  - psychometrics
  - research software
  - reproducibility
